    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d880">

                <pb facs="0831" n="741" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg741"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/938</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-11T14:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 11,
                                1918, 2 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My telegram No. 451, January 8. Finnish commission had audience yesterday with
                    the King of Norway, who welcomed Finland as <pb facs="0832" n="742"
                        xml:id="pg742"/> an independent sister nation of Scandinavia. One of the
                    members of the commission named Reuter will shortly leave for England and the
                    United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
